# Security headers, applied to every response. connect-src is the allowlist of
# every host Aura may contact — the Govee cloud APIs (which set CORS headers,
# so the browser calls them directly), aura-server (the one small Worker
# behind the feedback box — never lights, keys, or scenes), and Aura's own R2
# bucket (the speech-to-text model + its WASM runtime — see
# scripts/voice-assets.mjs; too big for Pages itself, CORS scoped to this
# domain specifically, still our infrastructure, not a third party). Adding a
# host here is a security decision, not a config tweak.
#
# script-src also allows the R2 bucket — onnxruntime-web loads its WASM glue
# code via a cross-origin dynamic import() (an actual <script>-equivalent
# load, not a fetch/XHR), which script-src governs, not connect-src. Missed
# this the first time: `vite preview` never applies _headers at all (that's
# Cloudflare Pages-specific), so nothing short of a real deployed browser
# could have caught it — confirmed on a real phone, "Failed to fetch
# dynamically imported module" is exactly what a CSP-blocked dynamic import
# looks like from the calling code's side.
#
# worker-src allows blob: alongside self — onnxruntime-web's WASM runtime may
# spin up a worker from a blob URL for its threaded execution path.
#
# Permissions-Policy grants camera/microphone/geolocation to this origin
# (`self`) — identify/rename uses none of them, but QR setup-transfer (camera),
# ambient "listen for the room" (microphone), and sunrise/sunset automations
# (geolocation) all do. Granting here only makes the browser API reachable;
# every one of those still only ever starts from an explicit tap, per Aura's
# sensor-consent rule — this header must never be the thing that decides that,
# only the thing that stops it from being silently unreachable regardless.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://pub-265b50abb06d41f9afcab96b2dee95ae.r2.dev; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://openapi.api.govee.com https://developer-api.govee.com https://aura-server.jdd994.workers.dev https://pub-265b50abb06d41f9afcab96b2dee95ae.r2.dev; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(self), geolocation=(self), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
